From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 19:59:59 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 07713/11362] [outer-loop] ARC: wire reauthor_framing into the
 live greedy-direct agent (REQ-ARC-WMTE-5834)

run_greedy_direct(reauthor=True): accumulate the agent's own (before,action,after)
transitions, and each reflection run the entity+HUD detectors + reauthor_framing to
retract HUD-band rules, name the mover's target, and override the counter-fixation.
The corrected framing feeds both reflect() and every decide_sequence() via a new
perception_correction channel. Non-breaking (reauthor defaults False); 22 existing
greedy-direct tests + ruff + mypy still clean. Next: measure whether it converts the
0/8 winner-recipe discovery to actual solved levels.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JntPrUGLNesPcJH1pyfFYw
